            "text": "Dubai is waiting for you!\n\nYou still have 5 days to apply for Digital Startups Scale Up accelerator program in Dubai for IT companies from Kazakhstan and Uzbekistan. In partnership with @difc_innovationhub and supported by @astana.hub and @startupbase.uz , the hub is opening doors for Central Asian founders. \n\n📈Why apply?\nExport is the next step, and if your startup is already growing well in the home country, it is time to look at promising markets. While MENA is one of the richest and fastest-growing regions in terms of IT, where projects from Kazakhstan and Uzbekistan can promote their expertise.\n\nApplication is available at the link in bio. \nDeadline: June 30"
